How to prepare a tomato soup

Which ingreedients are you going to need:

  1) 1,5 Kg of tomatoes (smaller tomatoes are better)
  2) 1 little spoon of salt and sugar
  3) handful fresh basil leaves
  4) 0,5 Kg of onions (the smaller the better)
  5) Garlic (4 cloves should suffice)
  6) 0,1L of whipping cream
  7) tbsp of olve oil

Step by step instructions:

  - cook the tomatoes for at least 5 - 10 minutes (the skin should be easily peeled off)
  - after you have cooked the tomatoes, peel the skin off and smash the tomatoes and then mix them
  - start cooking the mixed tomatoes, add suggar, salt and pepper to your taste, rather less and add those ingredients later after cooking 
  - after 15 min. of cooking add olive oil, garlic and onion and mix again (be careful)
  - cook for another 5 minutes and then stop
  - add basil, sugar, salt and pepper to your taste

Enjoy
  
